    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your tough exterior makes you hard to take down. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Constitution score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</li><li>Whenever you take the Dodge action in combat, you can spend one Hit Die to heal yourself. Roll the die, add your Constitution modifier, and regain a number of hit points equal to the total (minimum of 1).</li><li>You gain expertise in Athletics (Strength) skill checks.</li></ul>",
